# and belong in the finance drive, not in source control.
/*.xlsx
/*.docx
/AOP-*.xlsx
/Cassandra.png
/ChatGPT Image*.png
/Commercial Calculator/

# session scratch
scratch/
.env.bak.*

# ── Local AI tooling and vendored reference material ────────────────────────
# Removed from tracking on 7 Sep 2026: these added ~39 MB and 380,000 lines to
# the repository without being application code. .claude/skills and
# .agents/skills are near-identical copies of the same Claude Code skill
# definitions; docs/design-references is vendored reference material read by a
# local design agent. All of it is regenerable and machine-local.
#
# They remain on disk — only git stops tracking them. If a fresh clone needs
# docs/design-references for the design agent, un-ignore that one line.
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
docs/design-references/

# A 4 MB PDF committed to the repository root by accident.
Tech - Flipkart options  (1).pdf
